            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Kannada for to convert, then the Kannada for adequate."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ಒಂದೊಮ್ಮೆ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಒಂದೊಮ್ಮೆ — ondomme — \"if ever; should it happen\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಒಂದೊಮ್ಮೆ ಬಸ್ ತಪ್ಪಿದರೆ ನಾನು ಆಟೋದಲ್ಲಿ ಬರುತ್ತೇನೆ. ondomme bas tappidare nānu āṭōdalli baruttēne. Should I miss the bus, I will come by auto."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "It goes with a verb in -ದರೆ, as ಒಂದು ವೇಳೆ does."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಒಂದೊಮ್ಮೆ (ondomme) is native Dravidian: ondu, \"one\", and omme, \"once\" (DEDR 990): at some one time."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for saying what happens if."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
